{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","permalink_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/FFmpeg:4b0fad0...FFmpeg:39e1969","diff_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","node_id":"C_kwDOABiiStoAKDRiMGZhZDBjNjFhOWJhOTNlN2JjOGE0NjlkYWM4ZmYyMDhhNDVkN2I","commit":{"author":{"name":"Baptiste Coudurier","email":"baptiste.coudurier@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-12T21:40:38Z"},"committer":{"name":"Baptiste Coudurier","email":"baptiste.coudurier@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-12T22:28:14Z"},"message":"avcodec/svq1dec: set the key flag on intra frames\n\nIntra frames are self-contained and were only marked as\nAV_PICTURE_TYPE_I, so every decoded SVQ1 frame had key_frame=0 and\nplayers waiting for a keyframe never showed the video.\n\nFixes #25938.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Baptiste Coudurier <baptiste.coudurier@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"257b6f81fc8886f5cab0425505aa3c88573f9326","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/trees/257b6f81fc8886f5cab0425505aa3c88573f9326"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/commits/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b/comments","author":{"login":"bcoudurier","id":918644,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxODY0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/918644?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier","html_url":"https://github.com/bcoudurier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"bcoudurier","id":918644,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxODY0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/918644?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier","html_url":"https://github.com/bcoudurier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcoudurier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"a948f8e34a21ab457d533fe7ad18ec89fe9d5d07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/a948f8e34a21ab457d533fe7ad18ec89fe9d5d07","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/a948f8e34a21ab457d533fe7ad18ec89fe9d5d07"}]},"merge_base_commit":{"sha":"39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","node_id":"C_kwDOABiiStoAKDM5ZTE5NjkzMDNhMGI5ZWM1ZmI1ZjVlYjY0M2JmN2E1YjY5YzBhODk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nicholas Carlini","email":"nicholas@carlini.com","date":"2026-03-14T04:47:53Z"},"committer":{"name":"michaelni","email":"michael@niedermayer.cc","date":"2026-03-14T16:52:58Z"},"message":"avcodec/h264_slice: reject slice_num >= 0xFFFF\n\nAn H.264 picture with 65536 slices makes slice_num collide with the\nslice_table sentinel. slice_table is uint16_t, initialized via\nmemset(..., -1, ...) so spare entries (one per row, mb_stride =\nmb_width + 1) stay 0xFFFF. slice_num is an uncapped ++h->current_slice.\nAt slice 65535 the collision makes slice_table[spare] == slice_num\npass, defeating the deblock_topleft check in xchg_mb_border and the\ntop_type zeroing in fill_decode_caches.\n\nWith both guards bypassed at mb_x = 0, top_borders[top_idx][-1]\nunderflows 96 bytes and XCHG writes at -88 below the allocation\n(plus -72 and -56 for chroma in the non-444 path).\n\nFixes: heap-buffer-overflow\n\nFound-by: Nicholas Carlini <nicholas@carlini.com>\nSigned-off-by: Michael Niedermayer <michael@niedermayer.cc>","tree":{"sha":"3c4d8d4365b40c78d09d04dc1c99d27adf25cc72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/trees/3c4d8d4365b40c78d09d04dc1c99d27adf25cc72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/commits/39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89/comments","author":{"login":"carlini","id":1269300,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjkzMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1269300?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlini","html_url":"https://github.com/carlini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"michaelni","id":729390,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyOTM5MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/729390?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"795bccdaf57772b1803914dee2f32